    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Thanks for opening the request. This will be discussed at the maintainer's meeting today, the result of the discussion will be posted in the meeting notes (follow links from the wiki to them). I think that it is potentially something that could be made to work, but the effort is unknown and likely incredibly large. There would also be a large number of \"moving parts\" in the toolchain, which may also make such an endeavour more challenging.",
