    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "A summary from the maintainer's meeting: As somewhat anticipated, it was agreed that this is a large and complex task and not something that can be undertaken within the limited resources that are available at present. Were someone or group of persons to show up and want to do this, Numba likely has APIs to help with this task already (as demonstrated by the out-of-tree CUDA target). There were also concerns about the complexity of the toolchain involved.",
